+
 /* Hash table/map and list */
@@ -838 +849,8 @@
+  /*
+   * Observe the same response-code state space as AFLNet for benchmark
+   * comparison. This side graph is deliberately excluded from StateAFL's
+   * memory-state IPSM, scheduling, repeatability checks, and seed selection.
